 "entry": "noticeboard.app.build_app, the route GET /audit",
 "format": 1,
 "notes": ["The input is the query of one request for the audit page: the bytes after the question mark. Each input is ASCII.","The audit file is context.audit_file. It has three records of three calls, oldest first. The page size is context.page_size.","value.filters is the value of each of the three inputs of the filter form on the page. value.rows is the count of calls that the page shows.","The service reads the last value of a name. It removes the whitespace of Python str.strip from the two ends of a filter value. Then it keeps the first 200 characters. A character is one code point.","The service reads the offset with int of Python and reads a negative number as 0. It reads a text that int refuses as 0. int refuses a text of more than 4300 digits.","int removes each White_Space character of Unicode from the two ends of the text. It does not remove U+001C to U+001F there, which str.strip removes from a filter value.","The filter family takes a call whose app equals the value. The filter decision takes a call whose decision equals the value. The filter tool takes a call whose tool holds the value.","The service of the generator binds loopback and has no access key. Its state root and its registry are empty directories, and its attendance answers each call with no session.","The generator gives the app the request with no server and no client between the two. The app gets the raw path, the path with each percent escape decoded as UTF-8, the bytes of the query and the bytes of each header, as it gets them from its server."],
 "surface": "noticeboard.app.query",
